2. FFmpeg — LGPL-2.1-or-later (linked, not bundled)
---------------------------------------------------
Video decoding (H.264), pixel-format conversion (libswscale) and optional
yadif deinterlacing (libavfilter) use the system FFmpeg libraries at build
time.  FFmpeg is dynamically linked and is not part of this source tree.
Audio decoding no longer uses FFmpeg (see item 1): with the default
`-DUMDPLAY_NATIVE_ATRAC3P=ON` the audio path is UMDPlay's own code and
libswresample is not linked at all.


